til de los datos."},"1123":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers-14","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers#modos-del-buffer","content":"`BeginWriting` prepara el buffer para escribir y `EndWriting` finaliza esa fase. `BeginReading` cambia al modo de lectura y permite consumir los bytes existentes."},"1124":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers-15","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers#modos-del-buffer","content":"Esto permite reutilizar la misma abstracción tanto para paquetes salientes como para datos recibidos."},"1125":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers-16","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers#tamaño-y-posición","content":"Las propiedades principales son:"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers-17","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers#tamaño-y-posición","content":"Propiedad"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers-18","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers#tamaño-y-posición","content":"Significado"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers-19","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers#tamaño-y-posición","content":"`size`"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers-20","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers#tamaño-y-posición","content":"Cantidad de datos útiles."},"1130":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers-21","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers#tamaño-y-posición","content":"`position`"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers-22","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/transporte/buffers","tags":[],"t